{"hypothesis_id": "HD3", "rev": 8, "ts": "2026-07-11T09:05:00Z", "status": "measured", "result_experiment_id": "tb3s-20260710_h150anch_year_xsym", "statement": "HD3 rev8 RESULT - CROSS-SYMBOL YEAR ALPHA SURFACE of the anchored h150 policy class (prereg + AMEND1/2 followed; frozen protocol byte-unchanged; anchored dataset intervention col13:=day-first/col44:=0; 6 walk-forward folds x 4 seeds, t5, noA unreported; H_TICKS=1800 builds for BNB/LTC/SOL/XRP/LINK, BTC/ETH label files reused from 2026-07-07). PRIMARY - THE SURFACE (per-seed t5 EV bp, pop-sd; ENSEMBLE = deployed 4-seed mean-rank scoring, majority-vote side; jitter = score-perturbation P(EV>0) over 100 reps): XRP +10.97+-3.50 [10.6/11.4/6.0/15.9] 4/4 pos | ENS +12.68 (504tr, hit 58.5%, ALL LOFO >= +8.36, jitter sd.02 p50 +3.69 P100%, sd.05 p50 -0.31 P41%). BTC +6.20+-2.76 [4.5/6.9/10.4/3.0] 4/4 pos | ENS +3.83 (574tr; LOFO min +1.11; jitter sd.02 P56%, sd.05 P0%) - ensemble DEGRADES the per-seed mean and is selection-fragile. ETH +4.86+-3.83 [-0.7/7.1/3.5/9.5] 3/4 | ENS +7.36 (419tr; LOFO min +3.34; jitter sd.02 P23%, sd.05 P4%). SOL -2.59+-4.37 [-1.7/0.5/0.8/-10.0] | ENS -5.05 (P0%). BNB -4.24+-0.57 0/4 | ENS -3.00 (P0%). LTC -8.77+-4.29 0/4 | ENS -10.77 (P0%). LINK DEGENERATE (246d/2 folds; causal t5 selects 0-3 trades/seed; 2 seeds select zero) - no statistical content. REFERENCE ROW (rev7, deployed): DOGE per-seed +8.14+-2.55 4/4 | ENS +13.35, ALL folds pos, LOFO >= +10.85, jitter sd.05 p50 +3.13 P100%. SURFACE READING (conditions, not verdicts): (a) the policy class carries year-scale alpha on a MINORITY of symbols - argmax XRP ~ DOGE-magnitude; (b) THE ENSEMBLE-STABILIZATION EFFECT IS NOT UNIVERSAL: on DOGE it amplifies (+8.1->+13.4) and jitter-proofs (P100 at sd.05); on XRP it amplifies (+11.0->+12.7) but survives only sd.02; on BTC it DEGRADES (+6.2->+3.8, P0 at sd.05); (c) sign structure does not reduce to book density alone: positives DOGE/XRP (1.4-2/s) vs negatives LTC (1.3/s)/BNB (1.4/s)/SOL (2.3/s