e amplification now PRESENT for BTC-true (+9.95->+12.27, was ens-DEGRADING at H1800-anch) and ETH-anch (+5.97->+10.16) - ens behavior is funding/execution-conditional, not just symbol-conditional. (4) Fold structure: BTC-true has NO dangerous fold concentration (LOFO spread +9.7..+14.1, all-fold-positive); ETH still winter-heavy (f0 strongest) with weak May tail. SECONDARY DEPLOY-GATE ANNOTATION (rev8 rules): seed-gate (mean-sd>0): BTC-true +3.63 PASS, ETH-anch +1.50 PASS, others fail; perturbation gate: BTC-true passes sd.02 at P100% (sd.02 ~ the measured real live jitter 0.017) but FAILS the sd.05 stress (P28%, cf. XRP deployed-by-override at P41, DOGE P100); ETH-anch fails both (P65/P9). NO deploy candidacy declared; next per prereg chain = recorder-EV cross-check for BTC-true (+ the sd.05 fragility question) if pursued. Every number = cell: symbol x CL-year(2025-05-09..2026-05/06) x honest-h150-H5100 maker x t5 x frozen rev8-protocol trainer.", "note": "Artifacts (GCS): maker_labels_tb3s_h150d{,anch}/{BTC,ETH}.npz + daily/ (731 files) + OPTUNA_IC_{SYM}_qm0_SEED{0..3}.json x16 + PERFOLD_S{s} x96 + ENS_{SYM}_t5.json x4 + orchestrator logs. Invocations: build = orchestrate.py XSYM_TRAIN=0 XSYM_SUB_H=maker_labels_tb3s_h150d XSYM_SUB_A=maker_labels_tb3s_h150danch XSYM_H_TICKS=5100 XSYM_BUILD=BTC,ETH (hd2-feats-003 n2-highmem-8, ~2.2h, unit h150d-build); train = orchestrate2.py x2 (XSYM_SUB per variant, XSYM_JOBS 8 each, NTHREAD=2, SLOTS 6+6, xsym-32 resized n2-custom-30-245760 for the 32-vCPU global cap shared with live axb-xrp-1; units h150d-train-{anch,true}). OPS INCIDENT (logged in KNOWN_PITFALLS): first launch at 16 jobs = 226GB RSS/235GB killed the guest network (metadata/GCS/SSH unreachable, jobs uploaded nothing, ~8h lost, VM reset); relaunch at 12 jobs + 16G swap + RAM-clamp added to orchestrate2. Wall: build 2.2h + train 7.4h (2 waves); cost ~$29 incl. the incident (scope was $15-25). ETH fold5 truncated (data ends 05-08); BTC-true ENS fold5 n=4 trades - tiny cell.", "priority_rank": 1}
